        <div class="spacer-large"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="place-bottom">
      <p class="text-large padding-right-small">In keeping with its self-published roots and the ethos of the open web, <a href="{{ bookpress.links.book.url }}">The NoGood Book</a> is available exclusively through nogood.studio. Bitcoin payments are handled through self-hosted infrastructure, and every order is carefully packed and shipped from the NoGood studio in Amsterdam.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
